Dialogue: 30,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.50,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No... Not there...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:38.14,0:00:40.94,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Jeez, hurry up and cum already.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:42.69,0:00:44.69,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:45.19,0:00:48.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun, that's my...
Dialogue: 30,0:00:57.08,0:00:59.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I guess this is the right spot.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:59.21,0:01:01.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But, you know, you sure are sensitive, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.75,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:03.75,0:01:06.71,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I-I'm just doing this because it's part of our mission!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:14.14,0:01:15.43,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I'll finish it now!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:24.27,0:01:25.69,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:28.11,0:01:31.61,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:36.49,0:01:38.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Heart Hybrid successful!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.87,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Charging is complete, Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.39,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You're finally out.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:00.06,0:02:01.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:01.06,0:02:04.90,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Your Heart Hybrid always takes so long, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:04.90,0:02:07.52,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you were having a good time.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.48,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Th-That's crass slander!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:09.48,0:02:14.74,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I would never do something as obscene as this... for fun!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.99,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:16.99,0:02:19.29,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Anyway, now that you've recharged, get to work.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:19.29,0:02:20.37,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.12,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.12,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:42.06,0:02:42.89,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.65,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:50.52,0:02:53.07,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,A-Aine-san? What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:53.07,0:02:54.95,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be my turn next!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:54.95,0:02:56.03,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,No fair, Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Talk about an annoying crowd.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:57.87,0:02:59.12,Dialogue Italics,Both,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 30,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna, do it with me right now.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:06.33,0:03:10.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Huh? But your Hybrid Count is still...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:11.30,0:03:14.55,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,To change the course of this battle,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:14.55,0:03:15.72,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want the forbidden weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:15.72,0:03:16.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.30,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I am who I am.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.56,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, that won't change.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.23,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So do it with me...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:25.85,0:03:27.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let's Climax Hybrid.
