Dialogue: 30,0:05:26.35,0:05:27.35,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Dear Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.85,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I've finalized the paperwork for your admission to Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:29.85,0:05:31.35,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Come immediately.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.35,0:05:34.23,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Report to HQ at noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.36,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Reiri.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:35.36,0:05:38.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I hear from her after all this time, and that's all she has to say?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.15,0:05:40.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I can say anything, since I came anyway.
