Dialogue: 30,0:05:40.61,0:05:44.11,Dialogue Top Italics,Gu,0,0,0,,Now arriving at Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:44.11,0:05:47.95,Dialogue Top Italics,Gu,0,0,0,,Please have your ID ready for the border crossing.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.33,Dialogue Top Italics,Gu,0,0,0,,Welcome to Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.27,0:06:15.31,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,So this is the integrated research facility
Dialogue: 30,0:06:15.31,0:06:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's been training people and doing R&D to fight the otherworld invasion,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:19.32,0:06:21.90,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Strategic Defense Academy Ataraxia...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:22.86,0:06:24.07,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Are you a transfer student?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:24.78,0:06:25.74,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.50,0:06:33.04,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's Julicia-sama for you.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:33.04,0:06:34.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:35.62,0:06:36.92,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.92,0:06:42.42,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I can't ignore something so lewd!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.59,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,So this is where I'll be studying now?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:46.26,0:06:48.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel real...
