Dialogue: 30,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That guy must've dropped it...{The guy who just ran by must've dropped this.}
Dialogue: 30,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,H-Hello?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.15,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna, did you make it here okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:02.15,0:07:03.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just got here.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.44,0:07:07.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But is it really okay for me to attend Ataraxia?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,My grades aren't that great,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:10.28,0:07:13.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and I was already kicked out of here once.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.08,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear your excuses!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.58,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,I need you,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.58,0:07:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and your Heart Hybrid Gear, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's not going to be useful for anything now.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:24.59,0:07:27.59,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Just shut up and get your ass to HQ, Hida Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.97,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I always get what I want!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.35,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,And what I want is that thing installed in you, the Er—
Dialogue: 30,0:07:31.35,0:07:32.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I-I'm coming!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.85,0:07:36.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm on my way, so please don't say another word!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm lost...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.61,0:07:48.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,J-Just where is HQ?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:21.81,0:08:24.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Do you lack the intelligence required to understand language?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've met such a creature.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm Hida Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:34.03,0:08:37.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be going to high school here.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're a student here, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What else could I be?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:40.87,0:08:44.38,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm a weirdo who got \Na uniform and snuck through security,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.71,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,just so I could look at the scenery?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so touchy.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.59,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Touchy?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:50.59,0:08:53.85,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why would I waste my time being touchy with you?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:53.85,0:08:57.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It would make more sense for you to be on your knees begging to be touchy with me.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:57.22,0:09:00.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Like asking me to let you kiss my feet.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.65,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna beg for that!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:01.65,0:09:04.69,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're lying, you inferior creature.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:04.69,0:09:06.36,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What's with this girl?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:06.36,0:09:09.44,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,She's hot as hell, but her personality's so cold.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:09.44,0:09:12.49,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm Chidorigafuchi Aine, from Class 2-A.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:12.49,0:09:13.82,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Now, go ahead and worship me!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.37,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:19.96,0:09:21.58,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,An air raid siren?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,An air raid?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:24.96,0:09:27.13,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This place is supposed to be in the safe zone.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.13,0:09:29.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Their ships shouldn't be able to travel this far.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:29.51,0:09:31.26,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This is Ataraxia.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:31.26,0:09:32.80,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,There'd never be a false alarm here.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.97,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The enemy's really here.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:34.97,0:09:35.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The enemy...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.60,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You need to run.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:41.81,0:09:43.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:43.15,0:09:45.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What if someone sees you?!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:45.11,0:09:47.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The only one watching is you!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I told you to run, you lecher.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:50.53,0:09:53.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Y-You're the one who started stripping, you exhibitionist!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.66,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Just look away.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.41,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That way, there won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.41,0:10:00.41,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm a poor victim,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:00.41,0:10:02.12,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,and you're a perverted Peeping Tom.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.54,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Who are you calling a pervert?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:05.83,0:10:07.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A pilot suit?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You can't be...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.30,Dialogue Alternate,A,0,0,0,,Zeros!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:42.33,0:10:45.33,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,{\ko95}{\2a&HFF&}A Heart {\ko101}Hybrid {\ko104}Gear!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:45.75,0:10:48.50,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,She has a core installed, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.92,Dialogue Italics,Sh,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi Aine,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:49.92,0:10:52.55,Dialogue Italics,Sh,0,0,0,,your Heart Hybrid Gear is low on charge.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.80,Dialogue Italics,Sh,0,0,0,,You cannot fight for long.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:55.93,0:10:58.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You don't have to spell out the obvious.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.06,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,A Magitech weapon?!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:07.35,0:11:08.44,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I should go, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's all that stuff doing here?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I guess normal weapons really don't work.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:29.17,0:11:30.46,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sh-She bashed it?! {Ed: He's referring to her physically striking it.}
Dialogue: 30,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What an absurd fighting style.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.14,0:11:48.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There's an interception system here, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You just beat a Magitech weapon with \Na normal weapon and your bare hands.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.22,0:12:19.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,These things are everywhere?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:19.26,0:12:20.47,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.85,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,We never know when the enemy will attack.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:22.85,0:12:28.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,And fighting Magitech weapons is Amaterasu's mission!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:28.02,0:12:29.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Amaterasu...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.32,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,They never learn.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:38.32,0:12:39.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Evacuate quickly.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If you don't, you'll die.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Shouldn't I fight, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.91,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,I don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.92,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Hard work means nothing without the talent to back it up.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:51.92,0:12:55.34,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,Talent can be honed, but if there's nothing to hone in the first place,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.38,Dialogue Flashback,N,0,0,0,,nothing can be done about it.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:00.09,0:13:01.22,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my Heart Hybrid Gear's weak.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:04.68,0:13:08.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But maybe I can do something with it anyway.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.69,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,{\ko101}{\2a&HFF&}Er... {\ko107}Er... {\ko61}Er...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:11.69,0:13:12.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:12.44,0:13:15.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't say that name!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.20,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:32.00,0:13:34.75,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What's an off-campus student doing here?!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You have a Hybrid Gear, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.89,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:51.77,0:13:55.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If we don't all fight we'll be in trouble, so could you please not slack off?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:55.31,0:13:58.40,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh, is this your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.94,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,H-He couldn't possibly be my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.28,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How lewd!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:02.28,0:14:05.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We have a more important and \Nnoble goal than {\i1}that{\i0} to achieve! {Ed: "That" being getting a boyfriend/romance. Thought it could use a bit more clarity.}
Dialogue: 30,0:14:05.66,0:14:07.53,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:07.53,0:14:10.66,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Let's go take out these Magitech weapons, then.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:10.66,0:14:13.62,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, Ataraxia will be wiped out.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:13.62,0:14:14.83,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:14.83,0:14:16.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You get to a shelter immediately!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:16.88,0:14:18.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:20.26,0:14:22.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Those girls are fighting,
Dialogue: 30,0:14:22.63,0:14:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I'm...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:45.57,0:14:47.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can handle that, too...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:49.78,0:14:51.45,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,My Hybrid Count...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.96,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.22,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A-Are you serious?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What do I do? What do I do?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:14.73,0:15:15.98,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,Listen, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:16.35,0:15:19.86,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,A person's value isn't decided by their abilities.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.78,Dialogue Flashback,R,0,0,0,,It's decided by how they live.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:34.08,0:15:35.58,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Please make it!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:54.18,0:15:55.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:55.60,0:15:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, it may be useless junk, but how can it be this weak?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.45,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey, Chidorigafuchi! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:10.49,0:16:12.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Damn it! What do I do?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.83,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:13.83,0:16:16.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan! Is that you?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Good, I'm in a bad—
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.42,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.33,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I know your situation.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:20.33,0:16:24.34,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,If you want to save Aine, do as I say.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:24.80,0:16:26.88,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Fine. What should I do?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.30,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,First, fondle Aine's breasts.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What are you making me do?!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.64,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Be gentler.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.40,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Fondle them like crazy, but gently.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:41.40,0:16:45.36,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No, I mean, why am I fondling a girl I've just met?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.03,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Don't think! Feel!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.61,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Feel her heart and body.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:48.61,0:16:50.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Her heart and body?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:50.49,0:16:53.16,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,If you can't do that, both of you will die.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:53.62,0:16:57.12,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,If you want to get out of this situation and save Aine, it's the only way.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.12,0:16:59.50,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Only you can do this, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,O-Only I can?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.38,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Then think of it this way.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.96,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Check her body for wounds.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.34,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Every nook and cranny.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,O-Okay. I can do that.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.60,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Just keep going!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.52,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,O-Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:31.78,0:17:35.53,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I-I never knew girls were so soft.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.04,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Now spread her legs.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.45,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Get in between them and look. Carefully.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:39.45,0:17:40.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:45.21,0:17:50.01,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,It really just seems like I'm feeling her up...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:50.01,0:17:50.67,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:56.81,0:17:57.68,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:01.68,0:18:04.06,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I-It's digging in so deep.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.36,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What was that shaking?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Did a cannon hit?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.57,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Hurry! Time is running out!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I nearly...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:23.21,0:18:25.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,s-suffocated...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.47,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Is this the light of her Heart Hybrid Gear?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:42.68,0:18:43.98,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,She's so cute...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.73,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Now, Kizuna! Fondle her breasts!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:52.57,0:18:54.40,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:54.40,0:18:56.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm doing what you said...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:56.41,0:18:58.03,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Harder!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.20,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But that's not...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.75,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Just do it, and do it hard!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.26,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:14.55,0:19:15.93,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Well done, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:15.93,0:19:17.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,S-Success?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:17.84,0:19:20.26,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,The Heart Hybrid was a success!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Heart Hybrid?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.68,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,The fusion of heart and love.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:24.68,0:19:27.77,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,That is the true power of the Heart Hybrid Gear!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.27,0:19:29.19,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:29.19,0:19:30.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey, Chidorigafuchi!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:42.79,0:19:47.12,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What did you do to me while I was unconscious?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:49.67,0:19:51.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I feel so light.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.80,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No way. My Hybrid Count...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.80,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It was almost zero.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:58.80,0:19:59.30,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Commander! What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:04.56,0:20:06.64,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I'll explain later. Can you fight?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.60,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:07.60,0:20:08.48,Dialogue Alternate,A,0,0,0,,Zeros!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:10.56,0:20:11.77,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,With this power...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.65,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:21.07,0:20:22.33,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.26,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,She's reckless.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.34,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.80,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.80,0:20:43.89,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You beat the whole army.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Julicia! Hayuru!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:45.22,0:20:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the enemy carrier?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:47.48,0:20:48.64,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's retreating...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:48.64,0:20:49.52,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:50.35,0:20:53.11,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But we destroyed most of \Nthe enemy Magitech weapons,
Dialogue: 30,0:20:53.11,0:20:54.32,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,so let's be content with that.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:54.32,0:20:55.98,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But what happened?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:56.53,0:20:59.07,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Aine was like a totally different person just now.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.24,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:05.70,0:21:06.79,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Just who...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.00,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,are you?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:11.29,0:21:14.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:27.97,0:21:29.18,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 30,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we've made it through the first stage.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:35.02,0:21:38.28,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,The mission is far from over, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:38.28,0:21:40.07,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,the key to its success
Dialogue: 30,0:21:40.07,0:21:42.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is the Heart Hybrid!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:49.54,0:21:52.79,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,The key to retaking the mainland,
Dialogue: 30,0:21:52.79,0:21:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to retaking the world we lost!
